				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">- Corriente F1: Alimentación fresca (100 kmol/h de metanol puro):</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="35" left="30" top="1354.5" width="57.75" height="45.75" align-x="53.25" align-y="1380" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
