		<region region-id="48" left="30" top="1778.25" width="650.25" height="36" align-x="30" align-y="1788" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">- Torre de destilación T2: Separa el producto DME por cabeza (F6) y metanol a reciclo por fondo (F7):</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
					<sp count="2"/>* Destilado F6: DME = (1 - LK2) * f&lt;5&gt;_1, MetOH = HK2 * f&lt;5&gt;_2, Agua = 0 (no clave pesado).</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
					<sp count="2"/>* Fondo F7: DME = LK2 * f&lt;5&gt;_1, MetOH = (1 - HK2) * f&lt;5&gt;_2, Agua = f&lt;5&gt;_3.</p>
			</text>
		</region>
